Summarize what changed since a prior generation or instant

Usage:
  eshu freshness changed-since [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string               API key for authentication
  -h, --help                         help for changed-since
      --json                         Write the canonical changed-since envelope as JSON
      --profile string               Config profile name
      --repository string            Canonical repository id (required unless --scope-id is set)
      --sample-limit int             Maximum sample handles per classification per category (max 200) (default 25)
      --scope-id string              Exact ingestion scope id (required unless --repository is set)
      --service-url string           API service URL (overrides config)
      --since-generation-id string   Prior generation id to diff from
      --since-observed-at string     RFC3339 instant; diff from the generation observed at or before this time

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
